A new tileset for NetHack, available at
http://bilious.homelinux.org/~paxed/nethack/nhsshot/tileset/nh343-nextstep.png

This isn't actually a new tileset, but a reconstruction,
with some missing tiles added, of the tileset used on
NetHack v3.0 for NeXTSTEP.

The tiles are 10x10 pixels, so should be good for
smaller displays.


How it looked on NeXTSTEP:
http://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NeXTSTEP_Nethack.png

You can also see the tileset at
http://bilious.homelinux.org/~paxed/nethack/nhsshot/



The NeXTSTEP used one tile per monster class or item type,
so eg. all 'G' monsters use one tile, all tools use one tile.
The tiles are recolored on the fly based on the TTY color
of that glyph.  Most of the tiles are exactly the same
as they would be on NeXTSTEP, except I changed the 'e' and 'B'
monsters to show the colors better.  I also made several new
tiles which weren't there in NetHack 3.0, such as trees,
iron bars and gravestones.

